<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines' 91-day T-bill rate down at 10.746 pct.</title>
<headline>Philippines' 91-day T-bill rate down at 10.746 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines' benchmark 91-day Treasury bill rate slid to an average of 10.746 percent at Monday's weekly auction from the previous 11.172 percent, the Bureau of Treasury reported.</p>
</text>
